From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Caboose <caboose@invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/24] Wait for fewer replies

Commands that read no reply (destroys, frees, template updates, command buffer
copies and others) no longer drain earlier deferred replies first, and neither
do deferred memory binds or command pool resets. vkFreeDescriptorSets and
vkResetDescriptorPool, whose only result is VK_SUCCESS, are deferred.
vkGetFenceStatus never waits for GPU completion: it reads, without blocking,
the replies that have fully arrived on the single device stream, and reports
VK_NOT_READY while that fence's prefetched wait is still in flight.
---
 .../vulkan_enc/autogenerated/VkEncoder.cpp    | 116 ++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 79 insertions(+), 37 deletions(-)

